; Independent eight-junction two-row grid topology (Bundle F Cycle B training topology).
; Genuinely different graph structure from golden-reference (single loop, 4 junctions,
; has a tank) and branched-loop (single loop, 7 junctions, mostly branched, no tank):
; this is a 2x4 grid with three rectangular loop faces and a reservoir feed corner.
